    hollow_recolor: if component has enclosed holes, recolor component to teal(8) and holes to magenta(6) BEFORE outlining
    solid_keep: solid components stay blue(1); outline drawn around them
    hole_inclusion: holes treated as part of solid mask for outline computation

generation_strategy:
  approach: direct input generation (transform is deterministic)
